[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701873169","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103623#issuecomment-2701873169","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103623","id":2701873169,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hC1AR","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-05T19:28:11Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T19:28:11Z","body":"Tested and reproduced.\n\n[blame Skeleton3D::set_bone_parent](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blame/134da374975114ef8e05cf81d1d30eff645e310e/scene/3d/skeleton_3d.cpp#L737)\n\nmaybe PR: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97744","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701873169/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726413894","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103623#issuecomment-2726413894","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103623","id":2726413894,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6igcZG","user":{"login":"Drac32Drac","id":5100229,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDAyMjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5100229?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Drac32Drac","html_url":"https://github.com/Drac32Drac","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Drac32Drac/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Drac32Drac/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Drac32Drac/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Drac32Drac/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Drac32Drac/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Drac32Drac/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Drac32Drac/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Drac32Drac/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Drac32Drac/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-15T10:11:10Z","updated_at":"2025-03-15T10:11:10Z","body":"I just spent the past few days struggling with this one.  I can confirm that this bug exists in 4.4.0\n\nIs there a workaround to this?  Or alternatively a way to simply apply the entire current pose to the rest pose?\nThe editor button that applies the entire current pose to the rest pose seems to work.  But that function as best I can tell isn't accessible from code.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726413894/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726418859","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103623#issuecomment-2726418859","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103623","id":2726418859,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6igdmr","user":{"login":"alexnikop","id":32794058,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzk0MDU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32794058?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexnikop","html_url":"https://github.com/alexnikop","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexnikop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexnikop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexnikop/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexnikop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexnikop/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexnikop/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexnikop/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexnikop/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexnikop/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-15T10:19:32Z","updated_at":"2025-03-15T10:22:06Z","body":"As a workaround I calculate the global rest myself every time I create a new bone and save it in a dictionary. After that I can just retrieve any global rest from the dictionary when needed. Here is the relevant code to help you build a temporary solution until the issue is fixed.\n\n\n```\n\nDictionary<int, Transform3D> boneGlobalRests;\n\npublic void SetSkeletonBoneGlobalRest(int boneIdx, Transform3D rest)\n{\n\tint parentIdx = Skeleton.GetBoneParent(boneIdx);\n\tif (parentIdx == -1)\n\t{\n\t\tboneGlobalRests.Add(boneIdx, rest);\n\t}\n\telse\n\t{\n\t\tboneGlobalRests.Add(boneIdx, boneGlobalRests[parentIdx] * rest);\n\t}\n}\n```\n\nFeel free to ask any more help on how to work around this","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726418859/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726448003","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103623#issuecomment-2726448003","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103623","id":2726448003,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6igkuD","user":{"login":"Drac32Drac","id":5100229,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDAyMjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5100229?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Drac32Drac","html_url":"https://github.com/Drac32Drac","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Drac32Drac/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Drac32Drac/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Drac32Drac/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Drac32Drac/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Drac32Drac/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Drac32Drac/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Drac32Drac/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Drac32Drac/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Drac32Drac/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-15T11:09:17Z","updated_at":"2025-03-15T11:12:48Z","body":"I found another workaround that seems to work just fine.\n\nCalculate and apply the *LOCAL* bone rests *BEFORE* parenting it to another bone and it updates the rests properly.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726448003/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2969071354","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103623#issuecomment-2969071354","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103623","id":2969071354,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6w-G76","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-13T05:21:12Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T05:21:24Z","body":"Fixed by #105920","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2969071354/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]